QtWayland source licensing is recorded per upstream SPDX headers and REUSE.toml.
The compositor uses GPL-3.0-only or a commercial alternative; client/other files
retain their own LGPL/GPL/BSD/MIT alternatives. No commercial license is granted.
Exact upstream LICENSES, attribution and third-party notice inputs are staged
under source/ as listed in source-notices.json. Qtbase protocol inputs and their
notices remain supplied by the separately selected compatible Qtbase provider.
The source inventory is byte evidence, not legal acceptance.
